stment activities. The company was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in Muar, Malaysia.","zh":"Lii Hen Industries Bhd 是一家投资控股公司，成立于1994年，总部位于马来西亚麻坡，主要从事家具制造和销售，业务覆盖北美、亚洲、大洋洲、非洲和欧洲。公司通过家具制造、种植和其他部门运营。","lines":["家具制造：生产并销售办公和住宅家具，以及家具组件和加工木制品，客户为家具进口商、批发商和零售商。","产品系列：提供卧室套装、实木餐椅、办公家具、软垫沙发套装、多功能货架和小件物品等产品。","种植：通过种植部门运营。","其他：包括物业投资活动。"],"lines_en":["Furniture Manufacturing: Manufactures and sells office and residential furniture, as well as furniture components and processed wood works, to furniture importers, wholesalers, and retailers.","Product Range: Offers bedroom sets, solid dinettes, office furniture, upholstery sofa sets, utility shelves, and occasional items products.","Plantation: Operates through the Plantation segment.","Other: Involves in property investment activities."]}}